      "rid": "doc_1.src_content.0",
      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "God bless you Doris Panyard. I hope this finds you well and that things are brightening up by this time. I wrote you about a week ago, hoping to reach you next day after George phoned, but spoiled the card and this is the late result. I received a wire this Morning from my Rev. Brother Edward that our other Rev. brother, Father Maurice Joachim, died this Morning at 6 o'clock. R.I.P. Please pray for the repose of his dear Soul. Thanks be to God he was well pre- pared - over 81 years of a warfare - and probably one thousand of pitched battles ..... last.",
      "per_polygon": "God bless you Doris Panyard. I hope this finds you well and that things are brightening up by this time. I wrote you about a week ago, hoping to reach you next day after George phoned, but spoiled the card and this is the late result. I received a wire this Morning from my Rev. Brother Edward that our other Rev. brother, Father Maurice Joachim, died this Morning at 6 o'clock. R.I.P. Please pray for the repose of his dear Soul. Thanks be to God he was well pre- pared - over 81 years of a warfare - and probably one thousand of pitched battles. last.",
